---
export const title = 'Ghost text';
export const order = 400;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  With <code>ai-completion</code> and a provider that offers completions (ADR-030002), the editor
  registers a Monaco inline-completions provider: after a pause in typing, the suggestion shows as
  Monaco's own ghost text, and <strong>Tab</strong> takes it. <code>complete()</code> gets the code
  before and after the caret and <code>language</code>, and its signal aborts on the next keystroke.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <wc-code-editor
    language='javascript'
    ai-completion
    value={'// Retry the export, at most five times\nfunction retryExport(job) {\n  '}
    style='display: block; width: 100%; --code-editor-height: 12rem;'
  ></wc-code-editor>
  <script type='module' src='/assets/js/ai-demo.js'></script>
</DemoComponentCard>

<p>
  As everywhere, nothing is suggested while the page has AI off, or when the editor is read-only,
  disabled or <code>sensitive</code>.
</p>
